# Project: ws_weltmodelle — LeWM + thin reachability `φ`

Local research workspace. It is **not** the upstream `le-wm` repo at the
root. Python lives in the **submodule** `ws_le-wm/le-wm`. Git: `30-git.mdc`.
Runtime: **only** `docker/run.sh` (`40-docker-tooling.mdc`) — including CPU
tests. Do not invent a host `.venv` or use system Python. Parent
`origin` is `yojuna/ws_weltmodelle`; submodule `origin` is `yojuna/le-wm`
with `upstream` = `lucas-maes/le-wm`.

